sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Browser
    participant R as Login resolver
    participant G as Login guards
    participant V as Credential verifier
    participant W as libuv worker pool
    participant M as MongoDB
    C->>R: POST login with variables and X-GraphQL-Auth header
    R->>G: Validate method, supplied Origin and custom header
    G->>G: Count IP attempt, enforce one login per request
    R->>V: Verify supplied credentials
    V->>V: Validate input and reserve shared capacity
    V->>M: Find account by normalized username
    M-->>V: Account or no match
    V->>W: Async scrypt with stored or dummy password record
    W-->>V: Derived hash for comparison
    V->>M: Load public user for valid credentials
    M-->>V: Public identity
    V-->>R: Identity, release verification capacity
    R->>M: Recheck account/user and insert hashed session token
    M-->>R: Session stored
    R-->>C: Public identity and HttpOnly session cookie


